      en: ["Land reclamation for the island began in 2004.", "Total area is approximately 400 hectares (4 million sqm).", "The first project in Qatar to offer freehold for foreigners.", "Built on top of a former major pearl diving site.", "Features over 32 kilometers of newly created coastline.", "Designed to resemble a string of pearls from the air."],
